{
  "description": "An OBJ's text -> its parts as the model loader splits it (client.render.model.ObjLoader.loadModel): a part per run of faces of one o/g object and one usemtl material, in file order; a quad face is a quad, a triangle a quad with its last corner twice, a polygon fanned from its first corner; each corner [x, y, z, u, v, nx, ny, nz] as floats, v turned over (1 - v of the file; 0 with no vt), the normal 0 1 0 with no vn; the mtllib files as written. input.text; expected: {libraries, parts: [{object, material, quads}]}, or {error: true} if the loader refuses the file.",
  "frame": "obj",
  "tolerance": 1e-06,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "parse-a-quad",
      "note": "a quad",
      "input": {"text": "v 0 0 0\nv 1 0 0\nv 1 1 0\nv 0 1 0\nf 1 2 3 4\n"},
